{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act22side_level_act22side_05_beg",
  "groupId": "act22side",
  "stageId": "act22side_05",
  "title": "祝福的歌谣",
  "storyCode": "FC-5",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act22side/level_act22side_05_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "26379f8893a53199c78c922917a79e5fec906f776f0db2b34c5849fd9317dabc",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "text": "苇草，你那边固定了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苇草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "text": "嗯，没问题。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "text": "咻——好了，这是最后一顶帐篷啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "text": "哎呀，你们俩的力气可真大。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "text": "对了，你们是不是要走了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "text": "是呀，我和陈陈要调查的就是那些被法术控制的“鬼魂士兵”，这边的事情结束之后，我们还有其他的任务。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "text": "而且这里已经是特伦特郡辖区的边界，应该不会再有驻军找你们麻烦啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "text": "......唉，要是我们把秩序维持得更好一些，这么多混乱和冤枉的事情，就都不会发生了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "text": "啊，你在说什么呢？要不是因为你们，我们都不知道能不能活到现在呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "text": "如果这是在我家，今晚我就要请你们喝接骨木酒，给你们送行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "text": "不过我们现在手里的物资，大半还都是你们从......从那个“罗德岛”带过来的，哈哈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "text": "我们给那个罗德岛寄信，你们能收到不？到时候大家找到地方落脚了，跟你们说一声，你们要是再路过这附近，可以来做客。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "text": "欸，应该可以吧？要是维多利亚的纷争结束，然后陈陈也见到了那个人......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "text": "......你呢，苇草？接下来你要去哪里？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苇草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "text": "我......应该会确认所有人都安顿好了，再去做自己的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苇草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "text": "就算离开了石高原野，摆脱了罪名，没有了熄火钟的管制......塔拉人也依然生活在一片泥泞的土地上，他们还是会寸步难行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苇草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "text": "我觉得，我应该再帮他们想想办法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苇草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "text": "塔拉和维多利亚的语言，我都会说，之后如果进入城市，遇到各种不同的人，我都可以交涉......会比其他人方便一些。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "text": "啊，对了，今天你去找罗德岛的安全屋时，有没有什么人跟踪你？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苇草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "text": "......应该没有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苇草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "text": "没关系，我记得你的提醒。如果那些士兵是冲我来的......我不怕。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苇草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "text": "还有......谢谢你的好心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_725_1",
      "text": "你说，到时候苇草肯不肯把帐篷卖一顶给我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_725_1",
      "text": "那可是城里工厂做出来的帆布，暴雨浇上半个月也不会漏水，正适合拿来改造我的小拖车。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫兰",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_728_1",
      "text": "她心地很善良，你也不会昧着良心出价。我猜，你们的交易应该是能谈成的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_725_1",
      "text": "哈，我开玩笑的，我哪里有钱买这么好的东西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_725_1",
      "text": "不过谁能想到呢，前几天我们还为怎么活命发愁，现在却能睡进工厂做出来的结实帐篷，夜里也能生火了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫兰",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_728_1",
      "text": "嗯，她们很有本事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_725_1",
      "text": "也懂矿石病的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_725_1",
      "text": "（口哨声）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫兰",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_728_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_725_1",
      "text": "（不连贯的口哨旋律）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫兰",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_728_1",
      "text": "笼罩溪谷的雾霭啊......♪"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_725_1",
      "text": "......将她远行的身影遮蔽......♪"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_725_1",
      "text": "还是很好听。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫兰",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_728_1",
      "text": "......那些追过我的人里，现在应该只有你还记得我了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_725_1",
      "text": "别这么说......大家肯定都记得。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_725_1",
      "text": "矿石病又不是你的错。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_725_1",
      "text": "（有点跑调的口哨音）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_725_1",
      "text": "唉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_725_1",
      "text": "那小子，塞尔蒙她哥，死了。说不定我们当时帮过的那一队深池都死了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_725_1",
      "text": "我们白忙活了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_725_1",
      "text": "还好......至少你还活着，失踪了那么久之后，你还活着。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_725_1",
      "text": "我看到苇草给你塞药了，矿石病是不是其实能治好？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫兰",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_728_1",
      "text": "不，她们都说是治不好的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫兰",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_728_1",
      "text": "但是，请不要埋怨那些深池的士兵。我帮他们躲进工厂的运输车，伤口渗入了源石粗矿的碎屑......这也不是他们的错。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_725_1",
      "text": "没有，我哪有埋怨呀，我只是觉得心里难受。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_725_1",
      "text": "你们都相信深池，可我不敢信。深池是比我们厉害，还有武器，但我们都亲眼看到了，最后那队人被打得有多惨。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_725_1",
      "text": "深池会对塔拉人好，帮塔拉人出口气，可之后呢？我想不出来......我就只记得那天车厢上的血。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_725_1",
      "text": "塞尔蒙到现在还是想去找深池，去跟维多利亚人打仗，我都劝不住她。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_725_1",
      "text": "你说，那天她跟苇草聊了那么久，苇草难道没给她讲清楚道理吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫兰",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_728_1",
      "text": "可是我觉得，塞尔蒙那么做，不坏。她那样的人，能为其他塔拉人做很多事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫兰",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_728_1",
      "text": "你还记得吗？我感染之后不久，整个感染者街区的人一起被驱赶出了小镇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫兰",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_728_1",
      "text": "后来，被驱赶出来的镇民里更健壮有力的那些，抢走了大家身上所有的物资，留下了羸弱的老人与孩子，还有我这样在虚弱期的病人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_725_1",
      "text": "......你该早点说。说出来至少心里没那么难过。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫兰",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_728_1",
      "text": "但其实，我都快记不清了。我都想不起来，为什么没人反抗，也没人保护其他人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫兰",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_728_1",
      "text": "以前我一直想，生活就是这样子，手里捧着的无论是什么，只要肚子饿了，闭上眼睛就咽下去了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫兰",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_728_1",
      "text": "莉莎死在矿井底下，柯萝达也死在矿井底下，你们家难道有人抱怨过矿场的工作吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_725_1",
      "text": "呃......我说不好，也许是不能抱怨谁，但至少大姐和二姐死的时候，我自己挺难过的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_725_1",
      "text": "我想找人说说这些，但是又黑又闷的矿井底下，没人听我说。我跑出来兜售些杂货，结果每家人都有自己的难处，也没人听我说。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_725_1",
      "text": "好吧，现在说也不迟。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫兰",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_728_1",
      "text": "是啊，现在也不迟。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫兰",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_728_1",
      "text": "我们捡的这些木柴，应该够烧一晚上了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_725_1",
      "text": "（口哨声）......那就走吧，太阳落山了，等会儿你该看不清路了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "text": "哎，锅子咕嘟咕嘟冒泡啦，现在我能吃一口吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞尔蒙",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_724_1",
      "text": "别心急，你这傻子！难道你家里从来没让你烧过饭吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞尔蒙",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_724_1",
      "text": "去帐篷里等着，等会儿肉煮好了我端过去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_662_1",
      "text": "她看起来心情好了不少。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苇草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "text": "嗯......但她一定还是很伤心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_662_1",
      "text": "至少，让她死了去深池的心，是件好事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苇草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "text": "......你一直知道？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_662_1",
      "text": "我相信有你在的话，他们不会踏错路。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_662_1",
      "text": "......虽然你很难一直陪着这些人走，德拉克。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苇草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_662_1",
      "text": "我不会认错。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_243",
      "text": "别瞎说，费加尔，去年的戏里，你演的是盖尔王的战士。你演他重伤倒下三次又爬起来三次，结果把自己的胳膊和腿都摔青啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "text": "那我今年就演他刀枪不入好啦。年年都演盖尔王战败，演加斯特里尔死在王城脚下，除了戏服上能缀点花，就再没新鲜的东西啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "text": "嘿，塞尔蒙，过来，坐过来。我看今年你可以扮演盖尔王手下第一大将军。虽然年纪小了点，但论气势，还真没人能盖过你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞尔蒙",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_724_1",
      "text": "哈？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_243",
      "text": "你就是馋她端来的锅子，才对她胡说。你看她自己都不愿意。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞尔蒙",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_724_1",
      "text": "不是，你们在说什么啊？我不认识这人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_243",
      "text": "欸，你家那边到了夏天，不演那几出固定的剧目吗？我们在商量怎么分角色呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞尔蒙",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_724_1",
      "text": "唔......演到最后，一个自称河神的家伙会站起来往观众身上洒水，那个活动？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞尔蒙",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_724_1",
      "text": "......见过，没兴趣参加，除非让我演河神。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_243",
      "text": "那是河神在为死掉的战士哀悼呀。那段台词可比其他角色的都难记。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞尔蒙",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_724_1",
      "text": "啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_243",
      "text": "但也说不定我们还没建好房子，今年夏天就过去了。那你就能准备到明年。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞尔蒙",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_724_1",
      "text": "......是啊，说不定呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_243",
      "text": "看你这表情，你还想去找深池？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞尔蒙",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_724_1",
      "text": "当然。你以为我跟你们一样，说放弃就放弃了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞尔蒙",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_724_1",
      "text": "这是那天我跟苇草聊过之后得出的结论。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞尔蒙",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_724_1",
      "text": "我还是相信，深池的梦想是可以实现的，也必须要有人去实现。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苇草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "text": "......你想从我这里打听什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_662_1",
      "text": "我没什么可过问。你做的事，我看在眼里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_662_1",
      "text": "我信我亲眼所见得出的判断，也信罗德岛的判断。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_662_1",
      "text": "但现在大多数维多利亚人眼里，活着的德拉克，只有一条。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_662_1",
      "text": "......深池的红龙，塔拉的君主后裔。那一条红龙就足够让公爵们各怀鬼胎，贵族们人心惶惶。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_662_1",
      "text": "你一定为难。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苇草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "text": "那......她知道我的身份吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_662_1",
      "text": "风笛？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_662_1",
      "text": "她其实很聪明，心也很细。但很多事，尤其是和她认同的朋友有关的事情，她不愿意往坏处想。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苇草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_662_1",
      "text": "这样同行下去的话，她迟早得面对，你也是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苇草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "text": "......你要劝我尽早离开吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_662_1",
      "text": "做过的事情就是做过。需要你担负的责任，你逃不掉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_662_1",
      "text": "但我觉得，对一些人而言，你是不是德拉克没那么重要。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "粗哑的歌声",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_662_1",
      "text": "细小的溪流梳过茵茵原野♪"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "粗哑的歌声",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_662_1",
      "text": "我们为缺席的人举杯♪"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_662_1",
      "text": "歌声。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苇草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "text": "......应该是费加尔在唱歌。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苇草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_662_1",
      "text": "塔拉语？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苇草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "text": "嗯，听起来，是一首关于酒和夏日原野的歌。我没听过......但很好听。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "拍打着翅膀醒来吧，水畔的羽兽♪\n把我们聚会的消息随着水波带走♪"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苇草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "text": "......他们很开心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_662_1",
      "text": "听得出。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苇草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "text": "可他们只是有了帐篷和火而已。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_662_1",
      "text": "那他们有房舍和田地的时候，应该会更开心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_662_1",
      "text": "我们进去吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "text": "陈陈，你们终于回来啦！快来看奥兰先生的表演，他能吹响草秆欸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "text": "（尖锐的哨笛音）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "text": "哈哈，可能音不太准，我爹擅长这个，我只是简单地跟他学了学。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "text": "哼——哼哼——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "text": "啊，你们不介意我跟着唱吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "text": "唱呀，这是咱们的祝酒歌，我只介意酒瓶里没有酒，哈哈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "text": "那，歌词是什么？我用维多利亚语唱行不行？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "text": "唔......要不还是换个人来，你先听着好啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "text": "维恩，你来唱。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_725_1",
      "text": "唉......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“这土地总是结出眼泪，我们却饮下往昔的露与火。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞尔蒙",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_724_1",
      "text": "曲折小径开满玫瑰与风铃草♪"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "text": "你跑调啦！唱得可真够呛！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞尔蒙",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_724_1",
      "text": "闭嘴！你自己也没好到哪儿去！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "text": "（刺耳的哨笛声）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_725_1",
      "text": "呃......求你，别弄出噪音了，哪有你这样跟人吵架的呀......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_725_1",
      "text": "哎，也别再拿石头扔来扔去了！要是真没躲过怎么办！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "text": "哇，好香的面包......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年幼的流民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "可以分你一半哦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "text": "多谢啦！来，陈陈，你咬一口这个面包，就一口。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "text": "是不是很香？我在想，他们是拿什么草做的香料呀......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_662_1",
      "text": "嗯......吃不出。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "text": "欸，回炎国这么久，你的口味是更挑剔了，还是变迟钝了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_662_1",
      "text": "你觉得呢？其实龙门人夏天喝茶要用二十四种药材熬。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "text": "真的？......你又在开玩笑啦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_662_1",
      "text": "没有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_662_1",
      "text": "......你觉得高兴吗，苇草？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苇草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_662_1",
      "text": "他们的生活原本可以是这样的，当然，比这更好一些。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_662_1",
      "text": "你把生活还给了他们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "text": "苇草，你是会讲塔拉语的，别找借口，唱呀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苇草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "text": "......欸？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "text": "（俏皮的哨笛声）唱呀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "苇草",
      "speakerId": "avg_1020_reed2_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特别行动队士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_241",
      "text": "载具在泥泞地带会留下明显的车辙，我们要绕路吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲舍尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_4017_puzzle_1",
      "text": "不必了，直接向目标地点前进吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "text": "好呀，还有你呢，莫兰。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫兰",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_728_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerId": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "text": "莫兰小姐，干嘛坐在那么远的地方呀？苇草都讲了那么多次没关系了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_725_1",
      "text": "是啊，“卡迈河谷的吟游诗人”......唱吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫兰",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_728_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫兰",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_728_1",
      "text": "笼罩溪谷的雾霭啊......将她远行的身影遮蔽......♪"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "text": "哎呀，我是不是在好些年前听过这个歌声？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_725_1",
      "text": "你肯定听过。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "text": "对啦，我记得那时候我牵着我妹妹，她还没病到走不动路呢。我们在石桥上站着，听了好一会儿。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "text": "唉，卡迈河流得那么远，别处应该也有一样的桥吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲舍尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_4017_puzzle_1",
      "text": "先控制平民，但不要让任何人受伤。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲舍尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_4017_puzzle_1",
      "text": "我们的调查对象有相当优秀的军事素养，尽量避免正面交战。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔拉流民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "text": "塞尔蒙，你看，我这个招架姿势怎么样？跟你学的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞尔蒙",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_724_1",
      "text": "不怎么样。你以后也就赶赶羽兽，学这个干什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲舍尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_4017_puzzle_1",
      "text": "不要和任何人沟通，一句话也不要说。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲舍尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_4017_puzzle_1",
      "text": "后续的事情交给我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_662_1",
      "text": "别忘了，我们要在天亮前离开。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲舍尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_4017_puzzle_1",
      "text": "架好弩箭，准备烟雾弹。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_725_1",
      "text": "唉......我得出去缓口气。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_725_1",
      "text": "嗯？这个时间，起雾了......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_725_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "你们，\n是、\n是什么时候......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲舍尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_4017_puzzle_1",
      "text": "晚上好，先生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
